Hi Ido,

I think it would be great to get Stan and CmdStan into the official
Debian (and Ubuntu) repository. But perhaps it wouldn't help non-dev
users as much as I think it would.

Maybe the next time someone does a Stan talk they could hand out a
survey (or ask for a raise of hands) about platform (Linux/Windows/PC)
and, for Linux, distribution (Ubuntu, Debian, Redhat, Arch, other).

Best,

-a

